  "prefLabel": "Plc 1606.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1606.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) The standards in this part shall apply to each person who applies to be registered under RSA 326-M or who is registered under RSA 326-M.\n\n(b) Violations of these standards shall constitute unprofessional conduct that subjects the violator to disciplinary proceedings pursuant to Plc 1607 and other applicable law.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
